Package: kmod-3c59x
Version: 6.6.86-r1
Depends: kernel (=6.6.86~58358daaaf7179148d9bd1dccc220a17-r1), kmod-mii
Source: feeds/base/kernel/linux
SourceName: kernel
License: GPL-2.0-only
LicenseFiles: COPYING
Section: kernel
SourceDateEpoch: 1744562312
Architecture: aarch64_cortex-a53
Installed-Size: 71680
Filename: kmod-3c59x_6.6.86-r1_aarch64_cortex-a53.ipk
Size: 20799
SHA256sum: 73a49e4a40ca1410cd1f4c9d05e9192a688e839242cf5164004398cb02e02a9f
Description:  This option enables driver support for a large number of 10mbps and
 10/100mbps EISA, PCI and PCMCIA 3Com Ethernet adapters:
 - "Vortex"    (Fast EtherLink 3c590/3c592/3c595/3c597) EISA and PCI
 - "Boomerang" (EtherLink XL 3c900 or 3c905)            PCI
 - "Cyclone"   (3c540/3c900/3c905/3c980/3c575/3c656)    PCI and Cardbus
 - "Tornado"   (3c905)                                  PCI
 - "Hurricane" (3c555/3cSOHO)                           PCI

